t-level 'eslint --max-warnings 0' run (what lint-staged executes,\nincluding the e2e specs) exits clean, so adopting the shared config\nintroduced no new findings.\n\n* Hash all linted files in turbo's lint task inputs\n\nWith flat config, 'eslint src' lints JavaScript files too, but the lint\ntask only hashed src/**/*.{ts,tsx}. In practice turbo 2.5.2 still\ninvalidated the cache on .js changes (its hashing treats the glob more\npermissively than its dry-run input listing reports), but that safety\nlooks accidental, so this makes the inputs match what actually gets\nlinted. Also adds the .storybook and mocks directories that the\nstorybook workspace lints, which were never covered by src/**.\n\n* Add a changeset for the ESLint 9 migration\n\nPatch-level for the packages whose published source changed. The changes\nare comment-only removals of stale eslint-disable directives, so there is\nno functional impact on consumers.\n\n* Regenerate the API docs\n\nRemoving the stale eslint-disable comment lines shifted source line\nnumbers, and the generated docs embed 'Defined in' links with line\nanchors. All 42 changed files are line-number link updates only.","authorName":"Dennis Kigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"401e227eaf324ce8d2eb6332a411a6b8e5f86067","date":"2026-06-09T10:17:39+05:30","message":"(chore) Release v10.0.0 (#1794)","refs":"tag: v10.0.0","body":"* (chore): Release v10.0.0\n\n* (chore) Update @openmrs/esm-framework peerDependency to 10.x\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (chore) Bump internal @openmrs/esm-* peerDependencies to 10.x\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* (chore) Use workspace:^ for internal @openmrs/esm-* peerDependencies\n\nLets the published peer range track the package version automatically\n(rewritten to ^X.Y.Z by yarn npm publish) instead of hand-bumping N.x\neach major release.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","authorName":"Nethmi Rodrigo","authorEmail":"nethmi@openmrs.org"},{"hash":"fce9c4b688eb9b26df7f8354e1a30532640137cf","date":"2026-05-23T00:12:23+03:00","message":"(fix) Sort package names with localeCompare","refs":"","body":"Use an explicit localeCompare comparator when listing available package names in resolvePackages error messages. This satisfies SonarCloud's new-code reliability rule without changing package resolution behavior.\n","authorName":"denniskigen","authorEmail":"kigen.work@gmail.com"},{"hash":"f5fff6640b1fe94ca5b18e65e50f23ba98b2363f","date":"2026-04-18T07:10:42-04:00","message":"(feat) Add support to invoke develop with package name (#1750)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Ian","authorEmail":"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com"},{"hash":"1dcccfd421c94ee0f0a8aa6c7c974cadab3d5fb8","date":"2026-04-15T09:22:45-04:00","message":"(BREAKING) Drop IMO and don't load arbitrary content in production mode (#1743)","refs":"","body":"","authorName":"Ian","authorEmail":"52504170+ibacher@users.noreply.github.com"}],"totalCount":22}"}],"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01V77L1UChMYbp9Cwx4ZxXoE","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
